[38;2;124;124;124m$L^2(\Omega)$ is separable when $\Omega$ is an open subset of $\mathbb{R}^n$ [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m(for any $n$). $L^2(\Omega;\mathbb{R}^n)$ is also separable.[0m

